config:
title: Class Execute
theme: default
look: classic
---


graph TD
    Start([Start: execute]) --> Init[Initialize Variables]
    Init --> Check{Is Valid?}
    
    Check -- No --> Error[Log Error & Throw Exception]
    Error --> End([End])
    
    Check -- Yes --> Process[Process Data]
    Process --> Loop{More Records?}
    
    Loop -- Yes --> SubProcess[Update Database]
    SubProcess --> Loop
    
    Loop -- No --> Success[Return Success Result]
    Success --> End